.env
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
data/*.duckdb
data/*.parquet
# The Parquet warehouse (intraday_engine/storage/warehouse) is durable state,
# not code -- it must never land in git. It's persisted via GitHub Actions
# artifacts today (see .github/workflows/paper-research.yml) and is designed
# to move to real object storage later without any research-logic changes.
data/warehouse/
logs/
models/*.joblib
*.log
*.egg-info/
